=== SURVEY ===
Web AIFeatureCard.tsx is the REUSABLE AI-feature scaffold (not a data page): GlassPanel → header
(title + cyan "Helix" AIBadge pill + description + optional emptyHint) → optional inputSlot →
universal "Ask Helix" action Button (label "Ask Helix" idle / "Helix is thinking…" streaming via
AIThinkingDots; disabled = !canStart || streaming; aria-label "Ask Helix · <buttonLabel>") →
optional children → AiOutputPanel. The only data source is useTranslation; the stream lifecycle
(AIFeatureStream slice: state/text/error/start) + canStart are INJECTED — the card owns no
networking. By explicit design the scaffold is NOT wrapped with withAiFeature (the gate stays at the
call site) and does NOT own useAiStream (each feature has its own URL/body).
  AiOutputPanel.tsx: hasAnything = text>0 || state ∈ {streaming,error,done}; renders Helix error row
  (state error), AIThinkingIndicator (text empty && streaming), else the accumulated whitespace-pre
  text; renders nothing otherwise.
  AIThinkingIndicator.tsx: HelixMark + "Helix is thinking" label + 3 shimmering skeleton lines;
  AIThinkingDots = compact in-button dots. reduce-motion aware (motion-safe:).
  HelixMark.tsx: stylised vertical double-helix, viewBox 0 0 24 24, currentColor strands + 2 rungs.
  useAiStream.ts: AiStreamState = idle | streaming | paused-confirm | done | error.
Data sources (P1/S8): useTranslation. Shared components: HelixMark, AiOutputPanel,
AIThinkingIndicator, ui. Charts/maps: none. i18n keys extracted: Helix, Ask Helix, Helix is
thinking… (+ helix.tooltip/ariaLabel/errorLabel, ai.common.errorUnknown from the children).
Existing native: no AIFeatureCard* / AIFeature* symbols (no collision). Canonical pattern studied:
shared-surfaces/AICrossRuleConflictDetection (the web consumer of AIFeatureCard) +
AIChatbotIndicator (HelixMark Shape port + telemetry/source/projection seams).

=== REASONING ===
- Built a production-polished, reusable native scaffold mirroring the web component's parameterised
  API + every render branch, plus the P4 leaf connectivity axis. The card is generic over the
  optional inputSlot + children (SwiftUI @ViewBuilder), bound through AIFeatureCardModel (P1/S8); no
  HTTP/stream ownership in the view (the host injects the lifecycle through AIFeatureCardSource,
  faithful to the web "stream is owned by the per-feature component").
- Architecture mirrors the canonical AI shared-surface leaf:
  • Adapter (pure, Foundation): AIFeatureCardResolve (i18n seam), AIFeatureCardConnection (P4 axis),
    AIFeatureStreamPhase (verbatim AiStreamState port: idle/streaming/pausedConfirm/done/error +
    isStreaming/isError/isDone), AIFeatureCardButtonPlacement, AIFeatureCardContent (web props),
    AIFeatureCardInput (web stream slice + canStart), AIFeatureCardMeta (slug), AIFeatureCardLogic
    (buttonDisabled/effectivePlacement/showsEmptyHint/outputHasAnything/thinkingVisible — verbatim
    web booleans), AIFeatureCardAccessibility (actionLabel "Ask Helix · verb", badgeLabel).
  • Projection (pure): AIFeatureOutputState (hidden/thinking/text/error) + AIFeatureCardResolved +
    the AiOutputPanel precedence port; done-with-no-text collapses to hidden (children carry output,
    never a blank box).
  • Model: AIFeatureCardTelemetry seam (P1/S11 view.opened) + OSLog default; AIFeatureCardSource
    seam (Live + InMemory) with act() = web stream.start()/onAction; @Observable AIFeatureCardModel
    (binds source, derives phase/connection/output/buttonDisabled/isStreaming, emits view.opened
    once since the scaffold always presents, one-shot stale auto-refresh, action() forwards + no-ops
    while disabled); AIFeatureCardStrings i18n facade (table "AIFeatureCard").
  • Views: AIFeatureCardHelixMark(+Shape) — verbatim HelixMark SVG geometry port; AIFeatureCardBadge
    (cyan Helix pill, freshness-aware a11y); AIFeatureCardHeader (title+badge+description+emptyHint);
    AIFeatureCardActionButton ("Ask Helix"/"Helix is thinking…", computed-disabled, a11y verb fold).
  • Chrome: AIFeatureCardOutputPanel (AiOutputPanel port), AIFeatureCardThinkingIndicator (mark +
    label + skeleton lines), AIFeatureCardErrorRow (Helix error:), connectivity chip + banner,
    freshness helper, reduce-motion pulse modifier.
  • View (AIFeatureCard) + Previews + strings + Tests + AdapterTests.
- States rendered (every one — no hidden surface): idle/ready (invite card), disabled (action
  disabled + emptyHint), streaming (Helix-thinking button + thinking indicator), text/done
  (accumulated narrative), error (Helix error row), stale (chip+banner+one-shot auto-refresh),
  offline (chip+banner, cached, action disabled — no stream possible).
- Reusable API: generic designated init (model+content+placement+inputSlot+children) + unambiguous
  convenience inits (no-closure; children-only single trailing closure; live input+onAct). The
  inputSlot+children combination uses the explicit designated init to avoid Swift trailing-closure
  overload ambiguity (verified).
- Rejected: porting Tailwind/neon literally (used P1/S9 tokens); gating the card (web keeps
  withAiFeature at the call site — the scaffold always presents); owning the stream in the view
  (injected via the source seam, unit-testable); blank done-with-no-text panel (collapsed, P4 leaf
  "never a blank box").

